{"id": 14266, "title": "My roommate", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "my-roommate", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/14266_my-roommate.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我的室友是一个法国人，他今年25岁，因为喜欢中国文化，就想来中国工作和生活。但是他不会汉语，这里很多工作都必须会说汉语，所以他现在一边学汉语一边找工作。他白天有时候在家休息，有时候去学校上课；晚上常常跟朋友去酒吧喝酒，很晚才回来。周末他起床很晚，我们就一起做晚饭，晚上一起看电影。他每个月都有一次汉语考试，快考试的时候，我也会帮他复习汉语。现在他的汉语越来越好了，明年就可以考HSK四级了。希望他考试顺利，能找到一个好工作。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我的室友是一個法國人，他今年25歲，因為喜歡中國文化，就想來中國工作和生活。但是他不會漢語，這裡很多工作都必須會說漢語，所以他現在一邊學漢語一邊找工作。他白天有時候在家休息，有時候去學校上課；晚上常常跟朋友去酒吧喝酒，很晚才回來。週末他起床很晚，我們就一起做晚飯，晚上一起看電影。他每個月都有一次漢語考試，快考試的時候，我也會幫他復習漢語。現在他的漢語越來越好了，明年就可以考HSK四級了。希望他考試順利，能找到一個好工作。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ de shì yǒu shì yī gè Fǎ guó rén， tā jīn nián 25 suì， yīn wèi xǐ huan Zhōng guó wén huà， jiù xiǎng lái Zhōng guó gōng zuò hé shēng huó。 dàn shì tā bù huì Hàn yǔ， zhè lǐ hěn duō gōng zuò dōu bì xū huì shuō Hàn yǔ， suǒ yǐ tā xiàn zài yī biān xué Hàn yǔ yī biān zhǎo gōng zuò。 tā bái tiān yǒu shí hou zài jiā xiū xi， yǒu shí hou qù xué xiào shàng kè； wǎn shang cháng cháng gēn péng you qù jiǔ bā hē jiǔ， hěn wǎn cái huí lái。 zhōu mò tā qǐ chuáng hěn wǎn， wǒ men jiù yī qǐ zuò wǎn fàn， wǎn shang yī qǐ kàn diàn yǐng。 tā měi gè yuè dōu yǒu yī cì Hàn yǔ kǎo shì， kuài kǎo shì de shí hou， wǒ yě huì bāng tā fù xí Hàn yǔ。 xiàn zài tā de Hàn yǔ yuè lái yuè hǎo le， míng nián jiù kě yǐ kǎo HSK sì jí le。 xī wàng tā kǎo shì shùn lì， néng zhǎo dào yī gè hǎo gōng zuò。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My roommate is a Frenchman. He is 25 years old. Because he likes Chinese culture, he wants to work and live in China. But he doesn’t speak Chinese, and many jobs here require him to speak Chinese, so he is now learning Chinese while looking for a job. He sometimes rests at home during the day and sometimes goes to school for classes; at night he often goes to a bar to drink with friends and doesn't come back until very late. On weekends he gets up very late, so we cook dinner together and watch movies together in the evening. He has a Chinese test every month. When the test is about to take place, I will also help him review Chinese. Now his Chinese is getting better and better, and he will be able to take the HSK Level 4 test next year. I hope he goes well in the exam and can find a good job."], "english_full": "My roommate is a Frenchman. He is 25 years old. Because he likes Chinese culture, he wants to work and live in China. But he doesn’t speak Chinese, and many jobs here require him to speak Chinese, so he is now learning Chinese while looking for a job. He sometimes rests at home during the day and sometimes goes to school for classes; at night he often goes to a bar to drink with friends and doesn't come back until very late. On weekends he gets up very late, so we cook dinner together and watch movies together in the evening. He has a Chinese test every month. When the test is about to take place, I will also help him review Chinese. Now his Chinese is getting better and better, and he will be able to take the HSK Level 4 test next year. I hope he goes well in the exam and can find a good job.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì yǒu\" data-defn=\"roommate\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">室友</span><span class=\"tr\">室友</span><rt>shì yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Fǎ guó\" data-defn=\"France\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">法国</span><span class=\"tr\">法國</span><rt>Fǎ guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīn nián\" data-defn=\"this year\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">今年</span><span class=\"tr\">今年</span><rt>jīn nián</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">2</span><span class=\"tr\">2</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">5</span><span class=\"tr\">5</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"suì\" data-defn=\"classifier for years (of age)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yīn wèi\" data-defn=\"because; owing to; on account of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因為</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng guó\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wén huà\" data-defn=\"culture / civilization\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">文化</span><span class=\"tr\">文化</span><rt>wén huà</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiù\" data-defn=\"merely; nothing else but; simply; just; precisely; exactly\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lái\" data-defn=\"to come\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng guó\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gōng zuò\" data-defn=\"to work / (of a machine) to operate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shēng huó\" data-defn=\"to live\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dàn shì\" data-defn=\"but; however\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huì\" data-defn=\"can; to have the skill; to know how to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Hàn yǔ\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>Hàn yǔ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè lǐ\" data-defn=\"here\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这里</span><span class=\"tr\">這裡</span><rt>zhè lǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn duō\" data-defn=\"many; a lot of\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gōng zuò\" data-defn=\"to work / (of a machine) to operate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bì xū\" data-defn=\"to have to / must / compulsory / necessarily\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">必须</span><span class=\"tr\">必須</span><rt>bì xū</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huì\" data-defn=\"can; to have the skill; to know how to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Hàn yǔ\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>Hàn yǔ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"suǒ yǐ\" data-defn=\"therefore / as a result / so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">所以</span><span class=\"tr\">所以</span><rt>suǒ yǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiàn zài\" data-defn=\"now; at present; currently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī biān\" data-defn=\"on the one hand / on the other hand / doing while\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">一边</span><span class=\"tr\">一邊</span><rt>yī biān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué\" data-defn=\"to learn / to study / to imitate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Hàn yǔ\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>Hàn yǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī biān\" data-defn=\"on the one hand / on the other hand / doing while\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">一边</span><span class=\"tr\">一邊</span><rt>yī biān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhǎo\" data-defn=\"to try to find / to look for / to call on sb / to find / to seek\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">找</span><span class=\"tr\">找</span><rt>zhǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gōng zuò\" data-defn=\"to work / (of a machine) to operate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bái tiān\" data-defn=\"during the day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">白天</span><span class=\"tr\">白天</span><rt>bái tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu shí hou\" data-defn=\"sometimes\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">有时候</span><span class=\"tr\">有時候</span><rt>yǒu shí hou</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā\" data-defn=\"home / family / (polite) my (sister, uncle etc)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiū xi\" data-defn=\"to rest\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">休息</span><span class=\"tr\">休息</span><rt>xiū xi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu shí hou\" data-defn=\"sometimes\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">有时候</span><span class=\"tr\">有時候</span><rt>yǒu shí hou</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù\" data-defn=\"to go, to go to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué xiào\" data-defn=\"school\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng kè\" data-defn=\"to go to class / to attend class / to go to teach a class\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上课</span><span class=\"tr\">上課</span><rt>shàng kè</rt></ruby>；<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǎn shang\" data-defn=\"in the evening\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shang</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cháng cháng\" data-defn=\"frequently; often\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">常常</span><span class=\"tr\">常常</span><rt>cháng cháng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gēn\" data-defn=\"with / compared with / to / towards\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">跟</span><span class=\"tr\">跟</span><rt>gēn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng you</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù\" data-defn=\"to go, to go to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù